    "title": "Crossmath - Math Puzzle Games",
    "description": "<b>The BEST FREE Math Puzzle Games - Cross Math Game for you! Relax and train your brain now! Play it anywhere, anytime!</b>\r\n\r\nCrossmath game is a fun and engaging math puzzle game that tests your problem-solving skills. The game features a variety of levels and difficulty settings, so you can find the perfect challenge for your math skill level. \r\n\r\nTo play, you'll need to solve a series of math problems, using addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division. You'll also need to use logic and critical thinking skills to figure out the best way to solve each puzzle. Crossmath is a great way to get your brain working and improve your math skills! \r\n\r\n<b>Key Features</b>\r\n- Use addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division to complete the math puzzle\r\n- Multiplication or Division should be calculated first, and then addition or subtraction\r\n- <b>Unlimited Undos</b>. Made a mistake? No worries, just one click to undo it!\r\n- <b>Statistics</b>. Keep track of your progress with a detailed gameplay record. Monitor your improvement and strive for new high scores with each play!\r\n- <b>Large Fonts</b>. Worried about small numbers? No problem! Enable the Large Fonts setting for a better viewing experience. Now you can focus on the game without straining your eyes!\r\n- <b>Leaderboard</b>. Are you a competitive player? Challenge yourself in Endless Mode and check your ranking on the global leaderboard. See how you stack up against players from all around the world!\r\n\r\n<b>Highlights</b>\r\n- You can choose the difficulty of levels - Easy, Medium, Hard, and Expert.\r\n- Daily Challenge. One cross math puzzle a day keeps the neurologist away.\r\n- Endless Mode. In this mode, errors will not be checked before you finally submit your answers. The more levels completed in two mistakes, the higher score you will get.\r\n- Themed Events and Adventures. Wanna challenge yourself in the time-limited events? Try them now to unlock your special badges!\r\n- Star Race. Compete with other players to win rewards!\r\n\r\nCrossmath Math Puzzle Game is the perfect way to test your problem-solving skills and have fun while doing it. So what are you waiting for? Give Crossmath a try today!\r\n\r\nCrossmath also features a variety of power-ups that can help you solve puzzles faster. These power-ups can give you hints, advanced notes, etc. With all these features, this cross math puzzle game is sure to provide you with hours of fun and challenge. So why not give it a try? You can quickly master the game and become a Crossmath pro and math master in no time!\r\n\r\nEnjoy the math puzzle games and train your brain now! Download and Play this math puzzle game now!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://crossmath.gurugame.ai/policy.html\r\nTerms of Service: https://crossmath.gurugame.ai/termsofservice.html",
